            "review_text": "Trail36830017068\n2 contributions\n0\nEggs and eggs in the mouth.\nApr 2026 • Friends\nOnce we met a group of old friends that hadn’t gathered for a long time, we called for rice, shrimp, fried eggs and fish to try. This dish is crusty on the outside, the shrimp inside is solidly meat, especially the exploding fish eggs separating in the mouth. The whole group just ate and praised constantly because this is strange and tasty. The restaurant space here is spacious, so we just ate eight comfortable things without worrying about bothering anyone, the staff members are extremely enthusiastic to support.\nRead more\nTranslated from Vietnamese\nShow original\nWritten April 12, 2026",
