            "review_text": "bertviet111\n13 contributions\n0\nIt’s going backwards, from great to not acceptable\nFeb 2024 • Friends\nI have been a frequent customer at this restaurant since it open. It was always quite good and our group enjoyed it. However since about 2 months things gotten worst to a point where it’s not acceptable anymore .Service standard dropped to a level beyond acceptance. Whilst it’s not the friendliness, staff are lacking complete training. Order beer on draft takes 25 minutes to arrive. Ordering hot sake ,waiter not empty hot water fully so sake was watery. Yen calls itself sake pub, lately many of the sake choices are not available.or run out. Food wise the other day sashimi tuna was off, had to send it back. There seems to be nobody really in charge of the restaurant, can not make out to notice any manager around at any given nights. Overall service and food standard not lives up to our expectation anymore and our group decided to avoid Yen Sushi for a while.\nRead more\nWritten February 4, 2024",
